{"title":"Career Roadmap · Digital Marketer","role":"Digital Marketer","summary":"A Digital Marketer plans, executes, measures, and optimizes online marketing activities to acquire customers, build brand awareness, generate leads, increase engagement, and drive revenue.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"BBA – Marketing is a direct and strong academic foundation for this career because it combines marketing principles, consumer behaviour, market research, branding, business strategy, and management. The student should complement this foundation with hands-on skills in SEO, paid advertising, social media, content, email marketing, analytics, CRM, and AI-assisted marketing."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Focus","Typical Development"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Digital Marketing Foundation"},{"text":"BBA + digital marketing skills + internships + portfolio"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Digital Marketing Execution"},{"text":"Digital Marketing Executive, SEO/PPC/Social Media Specialist"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Marketing Management"},{"text":"Digital Marketing Manager, Performance Marketing Manager, Growth Manager"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Marketing Leadership"},{"text":"Head of Digital Marketing, Growth Head, Marketing Director"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During the BBA Degree","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Marketing & Business Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build strong understanding of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Principles of marketing"},{"text":"Consumer behaviour"},{"text":"Business economics"},{"text":"Business communication"},{"text":"Principles of management"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Market research"},{"text":"Branding fundamentals"},{"text":"Business psychology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Internet fundamentals"},{"text":"Websites and landing pages"},{"text":"Social media platforms"},{"text":"Search engines"},{"text":"Basic HTML/CSS"},{"text":"Content formats"},{"text":"Digital customer journeys"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The objective is to understand how businesses attract, convert, and retain customers online."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Digital Marketing Core"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop practical knowledge in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Search Engine Optimisation"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Keyword research"},{"text":"Search intent"},{"text":"On-page SEO"},{"text":"Technical SEO basics"},{"text":"Internal linking"},{"text":"Backlinks"},{"text":"Content optimisation"},{"text":"Local SEO"},{"text":"SEO reporting"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Search Query","Intent","Content","Traffic","Conversion"]},{"type":"h","text":"Social Media Marketing"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Content strategy"},{"text":"Instagram marketing"},{"text":"LinkedIn marketing"},{"text":"YouTube marketing"},{"text":"Short-form video"},{"text":"Community management"},{"text":"Social media analytics"},{"text":"Influencer marketing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Develop content calendars and campaign strategies."},{"type":"h","text":"Paid Advertising"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the fundamentals of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Search advertising"},{"text":"Display advertising"},{"text":"Social advertising"},{"text":"Retargeting"},{"text":"Audience targeting"},{"text":"Conversion tracking"},{"text":"Campaign optimisation"},{"text":"Budget allocation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CPC"},{"text":"CPM"},{"text":"CTR"},{"text":"CPA"},{"text":"ROAS"},{"text":"Conversion rate"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Performance Marketing & Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"The final year should focus on measurable marketing outcomes."},{"type":"h","text":"Web Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Google Analytics"},{"text":"Conversion tracking"},{"text":"UTM parameters"},{"text":"Traffic sources"},{"text":"User behaviour"},{"text":"Funnel analysis"},{"text":"Conversion analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Track:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sessions"},{"text":"Users"},{"text":"Leads"},{"text":"Conversions"},{"text":"Conversion rate"},{"text":"Customer acquisition cost"},{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"ROAS"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Email Marketing"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Lead capture"},{"text":"Segmentation"},{"text":"Email campaigns"},{"text":"Drip campaigns"},{"text":"Personalisation"},{"text":"A/B testing"},{"text":"Open rate"},{"text":"Click-through rate"},{"text":"Conversion rate"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the complete lifecycle:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Lead","Nurture","Conversion","Retention"]}]},{"heading":"Final Year — Growth Marketing","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Move beyond individual channels toward complete marketing systems."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Growth marketing"},{"text":"Conversion rate optimisation"},{"text":"Marketing funnels"},{"text":"Landing-page optimisation"},{"text":"Customer acquisition"},{"text":"Retention"},{"text":"Lifecycle marketing"},{"text":"Marketing automation"},{"text":"CRM"},{"text":"Attribution"},{"text":"Marketing ROI"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced Business Understanding"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to connect:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Marketing Activity","Leads","Customers","Revenue","Profit"]},{"type":"p","text":"This is what separates a digital marketer from someone who only manages social media posts."},{"type":"h","text":"Practical Projects"},{"type":"h","text":"1. Complete Digital Marketing Campaign"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose a fictional or real business."},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"typ